@page "/markets/industrial-iot"
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Industrial & IoT Electronics Manufacturing";
    ViewData["Motion"] = "market";
    ViewData["Description"] = "Industrial and IoT electronics at Hana: ruggedized PCBA and box build, connected device assembly, RFID asset tracking tags and power modules, in Thailand and China.";
}
@section Head {
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/market-page.css" />
}
<div class="mk-crumbbar"><div class="mk-wrap in"><a href="/markets">Markets</a><span class="sep">&rsaquo;</span><span class="here">Industrial &amp; IoT</span></div></div><section class="mk-hero" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="light" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap mk-hero-in"><div><span class="hero-accent" aria-hidden="true"></span><h1 class="mk-h1">Industrial and IoT electronics manufacturing</h1><p class="mk-lede">Hana manufactures controllers, connected devices and power electronics for industrial equipment, from ruggedized PCBAs through to complete, tested products. Industrial programs run at Hana plants in Thailand and China.</p><div class="mk-btns"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-primary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Talk to us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a><a href="#products" class="hana-btn hana-btn-secondary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Product examples</a></div></div><div class="mk-hero-media"><img src="/images/photos/mk-industrial-iot-hero.webp" alt="Industrial sensor and controller assembly on the production floor" /></div></div><div class="mk-wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:1;padding-bottom:52px;"><div class="mk-strip"><span class="hana-spec-label" style="flex-shrink:0;">Product examples</span><div class="mk-chips"><span>Environmental monitors</span><span>Smart meters</span><span>Controllers</span><span>IoT connected sensors</span><span>Label printers</span><span>Drone sensors</span></div></div></div></section><section class="mk-dark" data-hana-geo="side" data-geo-theme="blue"><div class="mk-wrap in"><div style="max-width:760px;margin-bottom:34px;"><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark">Ruggedized manufacturing for long product lifecycles</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="margin:14px 0 0;">Industrial and IoT products operate in cabinets, production environments and outdoor enclosures, and often remain in production for many years. Both conditions shape how the product is assembled and how changes are controlled once it is in production.</p></div><div class="mk-points"><div class="pt"><div class="t">Ruggedized build</div><p>Conformal coating, mixed-technology assembly and through-hole processes for products exposed to heat, vibration, moisture and mechanical loading.</p></div><div class="pt"><div class="t">Long-program support</div><p>Controlled change management and obsolescence support for industrial programs that remain in production over extended product lifecycles.</p></div><div class="pt"><div class="t">Multi-site manufacturing</div><p>Qualified processes across Hana sites in Thailand and China provide additional manufacturing capacity and supply-continuity options within the group.</p></div></div></div></section><section id="products" data-hana-bg="pcb" data-variant="light" data-fade="none" style="background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--line);position:relative;overflow:hidden;"><div class="mk-wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:1;padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:28px;"><h2 class="mk-h2">Product examples</h2></div><div class="mk-cards c4"><a class="mk-card" href="/markets/industrial-iot/pcba-box-build"><div class="mk-ph"><img src="/images/photos/mk-industrial-iot-card-pcba-box-build.webp" alt="Industrial PCBA and box build" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;"/></div><div class="body"><div class="t">Automated industrial PCBA &amp; box build</div><p>Ruggedized PCBA through to complete, tested product assembly, including conformal and parylene coating, mixed-technology assembly and functional test for industrial controls and equipment.</p><span class="more">Explore <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></div></a><a class="mk-card" href="/markets/industrial-iot/iot-device-assembly"><div class="mk-ph"><img src="/images/photos/mk-industrial-iot-card-iot-device.webp" alt="Connected IoT device on the line" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;"/></div><div class="body"><div class="t">Industrial IoT devices</div><p>Complete connected devices integrating the PCBA, wireless modules, sensors, battery and enclosure, with functional and wireless testing at finished-unit level.</p><span class="more">Explore <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></div></a><a class="mk-card" href="/markets/rfid/rfid-tags-inlays#asset-tracking"><div class="mk-ph"><img src="/images/photos/mk-industrial-iot-card-rfid-asset-tag.webp" alt="Industrial UHF RFID asset tag" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;"/></div><div class="body"><div class="t">RFID asset tracking tags</div><p>Rugged UHF tags, inlays and on-metal constructions for industrial asset tracking, supported by more than 20 years of Hana RFID manufacturing experience.</p><span class="more">Explore <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></div></a><a class="mk-card" href="/markets/power-management#industrial"><div class="mk-ph"><img src="/images/photos/mk-power-industrial-energy.webp" alt="Electric vehicle charging and wind turbines" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;"/></div><div class="body"><div class="t">Industrial application power modules</div><p>IGBT and SiC power modules and IPMs for solar and wind converters, motor drives and EV charging infrastructure.</p><span class="more">Explore <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></div></a></div></div></section><section style="background:var(--hana-blue-tint);border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:56px;"><div style="max-width:720px;margin-bottom:24px;"><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Where it&#39;s made</h2><p class="mk-body">Industrial and IoT programs run at three Hana plants in Thailand and China.</p></div><div class="mk-locs"><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/lamphun"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">Thailand</span></span><div class="nm">Lamphun</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/ayutthaya"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">Thailand</span></span><div class="nm">Ayutthaya</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/jiaxing"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">China</span></span><div class="nm">Jiaxing</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a></div></div></section><section style="background:#fff;"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:22px;"><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Frequently asked questions</h2><p class="mk-body">Common questions from industrial and IoT engineering and procurement teams.</p></div><div style="max-width:860px;"><details class="mk-faq" open><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">What does Hana build for industrial and IoT?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Hana manufactures ruggedized PCBAs and complete box-build products for industrial and IoT equipment, including smart metering devices such as water meters, heat meters and heat cost allocators, energy and environmental monitors, controllers and connected IoT sensors. It also builds industrial power modules and <a href="/markets/rfid/rfid-tags-inlays#asset-tracking">RFID asset-tracking tags</a>. Depending on the program, the scope can extend from board assembly through to complete, tested product assembly.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Does Hana build smart meters?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Yes. Hana can assemble smart water meters, heat and energy meters and heat cost allocators, together with the radio communication modules and gateways used to read them remotely. The scope runs from the PCBA through to the sealed, tested meter, with functional and wireless test set to the program&rsquo;s requirements. Connected meters and monitors are covered on <a href="/markets/industrial-iot/iot-device-assembly">Industrial IoT devices</a>.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">How does Hana support long-running industrial programs?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Hana supports long-running industrial programs through controlled change management, component obsolescence support and documented manufacturing processes. Ruggedization options including conformal and parylene coating are available where required by the product environment.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Which sites serve industrial programs?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Lamphun and Ayutthaya in Thailand and Jiaxing in China. An industrial program can be qualified at more than one of these plants to dual-source within the same company.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">What ruggedized finishing can Hana apply?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Conformal and parylene coating and harsh-environment finishing are available within our industrial box-build scope. The finish set is selected per program and confirmed per site during the program review.</p></details></div></div></section><section class="mk-cta" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="dark" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap in"><div><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark" style="max-width:520px;">Start an Industrial electronics build program with Hana</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="font-size:16px;max-width:480px;">Tell us what the product does and where it runs. We will point you to the right site and processes, and come back with a plan.</p></div><div class="acts"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-on-dark" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Contact us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a></div></div></section>

@section Scripts {
    <script src="~/js/market-sidebar.js"></script>
}
